    "body": "urlForState is not what [pushState/replaceState call](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/e8c12535c74ae70cd22109daed317e6fe4df2f73/Source/WebCore/page/History.h#L95-L103) as far as I can tell. They call [stateObjectAdded](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/e8c12535c74ae70cd22109daed317e6fe4df2f73/Source/WebCore/page/History.cpp#L186-L287) and that has\r\n```c++\r\n    if (!urlString.isEmpty())\r\n        frame->document()->updateURLForPushOrReplaceState(fullURL);\r\n```",
