    "created_at": "2023-05-31T12:12:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-31T12:13:00Z",
    "body": "(There might be a larger issue here. As part of some refactoring in WebKit I noticed many URL-consuming endpoints branch on the empty string. Some do so after ASCII whitespace removal, some don't. I suspect the same applies to Chromium.)",
